+{"schemaVersion":"1","kind":"finding","id":"fnd_01M2GSDSCS1E1NHBB2A9JSA11J","recordedAt":"2026-09-14T21:12:30Z","companyId":"example-co","title":"PR template for mongodb-mcp-server has no security/data-impact checklist despite pii and financial data downstream","description":"codeReview.required is true in policy. The only PR template, .github/pull_request_template.md (5 lines), contains a 'Proposed changes' heading and a single CLA-signature checkbox, no security or data-classification prompt. applications/mcp-gateway/env/prod.json and env/qa.json both list dataClassification [pii, financial], and details.json criticalFunctions ties appId mcp-gateway to order-routing, so reviewers of this repo's PRs are never prompted to consider security or data impact.\n\nImpact: Reviewers approving changes to a repo that ships an internet/partner-reachable, write-capable database MCP server handling pii and financial data have no prompted checklist to confirm security review, threat consideration or data-handling impact before merge.\n\nRemediation: Extend the PR template with a security/data-impact checklist (data classes touched, auth/authz impact, new external calls or tools, threat-model reviewed) consistent with sdlc/policy.json codeReview and aiCodingPolicy.allowedDataClasses.","severity":"medium","confidence":"confirmed","controlIds":["sebi-cscrf-2024:PR.IP.S2","dpdp-rules-2025:6(1)(g)"],"regulatoryRefs":[{"regulator":"SEBI","instrument":"sebi-cscrf-2024","controlId":"PR.IP.S2"},{"regulator":"NIST","instrument":"nist-ssdf-800-218","controlId":"PW.7.1"},{"regulator":"MeitY","instrument":"dpdp-rules-2025","controlId":"6(1)(g)"}],"target":{"type":"repo","appId":"mcp-gateway","repoId":"mongodb-mcp-server"},"location":{"path":".github/pull_request_template.md","startLine":1,"endLine":5},"fingerprint":"fa0d100e5cc99fa59ad4b8db883a630041af7983199a5da87e42d0384f3c2cb6","source":{"kind":"sarif","ruleId":"ssdf-pw-7-1-no-pr-security-checklist","tool":"maxwell-sdlc-auditor","toolVer