+{"schemaVersion":"1","kind":"finding","id":"fnd_01M2GSSNY7B64D39NPE9K8Z80F","recordedAt":"2026-09-14T21:12:30Z","companyId":"example-co","title":"No lockfile committed for db-models' only Python package manifest despite policy requiring one","description":"sdlc/policy.json dependencyPolicy.lockfilesRequired is true. The repo's only packageManifests entry, setup.py, pins install_requires=[\"mongoengine==0.24.1\"] but the repository has no lockfile of any kind committed (no requirements*.txt.lock, Pipfile.lock, poetry.lock, or pip-compile output); a full tree search of the checkout found none. Impact: without a lockfile, an install of this library can silently resolve to a different transitive dependency set on each build, so a vulnerability introduced upstream, or a supply-chain substitution, is not reproducibly pinned or auditable. Remediation: generate and commit a lockfile (pip-compile requirements.txt, or migrate to a poetry/pip-tools managed project) and add it to CI once CI exists; re-run probe-sdlc to confirm.","severity":"medium","confidence":"confirmed","controlIds":["sebi-cscrf-2024:PR.IP.S2"],"regulatoryRefs":[{"regulator":"SEBI","instrument":"sebi-cscrf-2024","controlId":"PR.IP.S2"},{"regulator":"NIST","instrument":"nist-ssdf-800-218","controlId":"PW.4.1"}],"target":{"type":"repo","appId":"db-models","repoId":"onfinance-db-model-master"},"location":{"path":"setup.py","startLine":19,"endLine":19},"source":{"kind":"sarif","ruleId":"ssdf-pw-4-1-missing-lockfile","tool":"maxwell-sdlc-auditor","toolVersion":"1.0.0"},"fingerprint":"96f1cf43c2e58353fcaf38eca2a3f6d8dee5606394f80246184c72c634580c23","status":"triaged","firstSeenAt":"2026-09-14T19:35:56Z","lastSeenAt":"2026-09-14T19:35:56Z","slaBasis":{"instrument":"sebi-cscrf-2024","controlId":"PR.MA.S3","topic":"patch-sla","severity":"medium","days":14},"slaDueAt":"2026-09-28T19:35:56Z","relatedObservationIds":["obs_01M2GSSNS325DSJVHAE5VMM8ZD"],"evidence":[{"type":"workspace-file","ref":"applications/db-models/r